        "code": "// Vi du xu ly so lieu da thu, khong tu doc cam bien.\nvoid setup() {\n  Serial.begin(9600);\n  const float reference[] = {10, 20, 30};\n  const float measured[] = {11, 21, 31};\n  float offset = 0;\n  for (int i = 0; i < 3; ++i) offset += measured[i] - reference[i];\n  offset /= 3.0f;\n  float newMeasured = 26.2f; // Mau moi, moc chuan 25 cm\n  float corrected = newMeasured - offset;\n  Serial.print(\"Offset cm: \"); Serial.println(offset);\n  Serial.print(\"Corrected cm: \"); Serial.println(corrected);\n}\nvoid loop() {}\n",
